<title>DUBAI: Saudi Crown Prince arrives in UAE to visit leader.</title>
<headline>Saudi Crown Prince arrives in UAE to visit leader.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's Crown Prince Abdullah arrived in Abu Dhabi on Saturday to congratulate United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan on his recovery from a neck operation.</p>
<p>The official news agency WAM gave no further details.</p>
</text>
